      "content": "Business banking API for Qonto - programmatic access to business accounts, EUR transactions, SEPA and international transfers, cards, client and supplier invoices, SEPA Direct Debit, payment links, terminals, and webhooks. Authenticated with a login+secret-key API key or OAuth 2.0. Modeled from public documentation.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Qonto Developers",
